cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "For a released version, cite its Zenodo record using the archived title and version DOI. See CITING.md for citation examples and the project rename history."
type: software
title: "SawSim: An open-source solver for surface acoustic wave simulation"
abstract: >
  A MATLAB + Gmsh piezoelectric finite-element solver for the frequency-domain
  simulation and design of Surface Acoustic Wave (SAW) resonators and filters,
  with vectorized assembly, complex-coordinate-stretched PML and parfor-parallel
  Y11 admittance sweeps.
